      "text": "Paso 2 · ¿N es primo? Calcular φ(N)",
      "fontSize": 28.312360017548762,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Paso 2 · ¿N es primo? Calcular φ(N)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UDh_ahMMMNrrRgMif07uQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 304.1818863519331,
      "y": 9404.45632857652,
      "width": 781.65966796875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 634075683,
      "version": 169,
      "versionNonce": 256062691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794088102844,
      "created": 1794088096805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "40 es par, así que no es primo y no se puede usar N − 1. Se factoriza: 40 = 2³·5.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "40 es par, así que no es primo y no se puede usar N − 1. Se factoriza: 40 = 2³·5.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lZ1o3LmLUqF0U4_PSPUR0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 306.8091588436741,
      "y": 9518.833979544099,
      "width": 422.9197998046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1424971629,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 1598803523,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794088969609,
      "created": 1794088114915,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "φ(40) = 40·(1 − 1/2)·(1 − 1/5) = 40·½·⅘ = 16",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "φ(40) = 40·(1 − 1/2)·(1 − 1/5) = 40·½·⅘ = 16",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q5JzxjTeNX0Udsigh2AIP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 302.7739701375938,
      "y": 9629.763958932712,
      "width": 498.5396423339844,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3k",
      "roundness": null,
